BALD CONTROL-ID MAP
Plain-text reference, not loaded by Kodi. Control IDs are scoped to their window, so the
same number can mean different things in different windows (e.g. 9000, 9100, 50).
Keep this file in step when adding or moving IDs in Bald-native files.
